&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text5" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;３．確定拠出年金制度&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:21pt;text-indent:10.5pt;font-size:10.5pt;"&gt;当社の確定拠出年金制度への要拠出額は、前連結会計年度45百万円、当連結会計年度46百万円であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:21pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:10.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRetirementBenefitsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesTaxEffectAccountingConsolidatedFinancialStatementsTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">
